 "summary": "The Z-4AI converts four ±10 V / ±20 mA single-ended inputs to normalized 16-bit values readable over RS-485 Modbus RTU. Everything is in single 16-bit holding registers: comms settings, per-channel filters and scaling, the four measurements and, from firmware 737, channel differences.",
